Z||000000||rogergarrison||06-05-2001||08:25 AM||||Dont forget our club sponsored Rally this Sunday. Any one/car is welcome. You can register between 10am and 1230 at the parking lot just south of I-70 @ Rt 13(Newark) exit.<BR>$10 each, ez to follow route to Old Mans Cave. its rain or shine. 1/2 the money goes to one with best poker hand + itll be lots of fun. Not any kind of speed or racing event, all luck of the draw. <P>(but you can open it up, Ive only seen a cop on the whole route once) Lots of hills, curves to play on. Me and a Firebird played cat n mouse this past weekend running up to 120+ on a few stretches.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
